<!-- Teaching layer over the approved Patterns source 4520147. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The payment succeeds while the receipt screen is being recreated. The ViewModel knows which receipt to show, but no view is collecting for a moment. Decide what the next view needs to see to finish the interaction.</p>

<!-- @before 5. Failure Modes & Tradeoffs :: staff -->
### Keep required progress until it is acknowledged

Follow the receipt request through success, collector recreation and UI acknowledgement. The request stays in state until the UI handles that request ID. This covers a gap in collection while the state owner survives. Recover the actual order state from a durable source after process death. [Android UI events](https://developer.android.com/topic/architecture/ui-layer/events).
